<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><title>Keluar — PALL 8BP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png"></head>
<body class="dashboard-page logout-page">
  <main class="logout-card">
    <img class="logout-logo" src="/logo.png" alt="PALL logo">
    <span class="eyebrow">KONFIRMASI</span>
    <h1>Keluar dari panel?</h1>
    <p>Sesi login Anda di perangkat ini akan diakhiri.</p>
    <form method="POST" action="/logout" class="logout-actions">
      <a class="logout-cancel" href="/">Batal</a>
      <button type="submit" class="logout-confirm">Ya, keluar</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
